<p>Thanks to your newfound knowledge of corruption, you've learned some tricks for toughening your body&hellip; but only if you are healthy enough to withstand the strain from the changes.</p><p>Improves your life by 500, your defense by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">3, 8, 16, 25, 33,</acronym> your armour by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">2, 7, 14, 21, 28,</acronym> your armour hardiness by 20% and your saves by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">3, 8, 16, 25, 33</acronym> as your natural toughness and reflexes are pushed beyond their normal limits.</p><p>Your saves armour and defense will improve with your Constitution.</p>